    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73552" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-γνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the same race,
			brother</i> or <i>sister,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἣ πατρὸς ὁ. ἐστιν ἐμοῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1076
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.743
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. πήματα</span>”
				<i>in the family,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					APl.
					4.44
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τῶν μέσων καὶ οἷον ὁμογνίων
					εἰδῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
					p.521
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ ὁ.</span> gods <i>who protect a
				race</i> or <i>family,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1333
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				729c
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ὁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					921
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				750
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				881d
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
